**Verdict:** The Cert Tax is avoidable. IGI D-VVS2 at $4,756 costs $3,501 less than GIA D-VVS1 at $8,257. For most purchases, that $3,501 belongs in your setting budget or your pocket — not in a cert name.

## Entry Tier — IGI 3ct E-VS1 Ideal ($3,819)

The entry floor for true 3.00ct lab marquise in current certified inventory is $3,819 — IGI E-VS1 Ideal.

**What you get at $3,819:** E colour — essentially colourless, visually identical to D. VS1 clarity — eye-clean with no visible inclusions. Ideal cut — the highest cut tier in the inventory. This is the only 3.00ct lab marquise with Ideal cut at entry price. Face-up: approximately 17x8mm — 15–20% more face-up area than a 2ct round.

The natural comparison at this tier: natural G-VS2 at 3ct costs ~$15,000. The lab E-VS1 is a better grade at 75% less. The lab stone grades higher on colour and clarity AND costs a quarter of the price.

