## VVS2 Tier — IGI 3ct D-VVS2 ($4,756–$5,765)

The D-VVS2 tier is where 3ct lab marquise shopping gets interesting. Two stones. Same grade. $1,009 apart.

**D-VVS2 Excellent at $4,756** — the value pick. D colour, VVS2 clarity, Excellent cut. $937 over the entry E-VS1 for one colour step (E→D) and one clarity tier (VS1→VVS2).

**D-VVS2 Ideal at $5,765** — the same grade, Ideal cut. $1,009 more than Excellent for one cut grade upgrade.

The Excellent vs Ideal cut difference at 3ct: both are top-tier grades. In practice, both produce brilliant stones. The video test is the only way to confirm. If the $4,756 Excellent has a cleaner belly in the 360° video than the $5,765 Ideal, choose the Excellent. Cut grade is a label. The video shows reality.

