Updated {{month_year}} with full current certified 3ct lab grown marquise inventory — 8 true 3.00ct stones from $3,819 to $11,108, plus sub-3ct arbitrage picks from $2,646, all verified against live data. Identified the 4 Ways framework after auditing every stone: skip D-VVS1 (save $1,759), demand Excellent/Ideal cut (avoid the Very Good bow-tie trap), use sub-3ct arbitrage (2.82ct E-VS1 Ideal at $3,289), and avoid the GIA Cert Tax ($1,742 premium on a lab stone). The 3ct Price Cliff confirms a 15% per-carat lab premium at 3ct vs 2ct — less than the 33% per-carat spike on natural 3ct stones. Natural D-VVS1 at ~$30,000 vs lab D-VVS1 at $6,515 is 4.6x — verified against current market data.

